{
  "sn7.10:0.1": "Linked Discourses 7.10 ",
  "sn7.10:0.2": "1. The Perfected Ones ",
  "sn7.10:0.3": "Many Daughters ",
  "sn7.10:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying in the land of the Kosalans in a certain forest grove. ",
  "sn7.10:1.2": "Now at that time one of the brahmins of the Bhāradvāja clan had lost fourteen oxen. ",
  "sn7.10:1.3": "While looking for them he went to that forest grove, where he saw the Buddha sitting down cross-legged, his body set straight, and mindfulness brought to the present. ",
  "sn7.10:1.4": "He went up to the Buddha, and recited these verses in the Buddha’s presence: ",
  "sn7.10:2.1": "“This ascetic mustn’t have ",
  "sn7.10:2.2": "fourteen oxen ",
  "sn7.10:2.3": "missing for the past six days: ",
  "sn7.10:2.4": "that’s why this ascetic is happy. ",
  "sn7.10:3.1": "This ascetic mustn’t have ",
  "sn7.10:3.2": "a field of sesame ruined, ",
  "sn7.10:3.3": "with just one or two leaves: ",
  "sn7.10:3.4": "that’s why this ascetic is happy. ",
  "sn7.10:4.1": "This ascetic mustn’t have ",
  "sn7.10:4.2": "rats in a vacant barn ",
  "sn7.10:4.3": "dancing merrily: ",
  "sn7.10:4.4": "that’s why this ascetic is happy. ",
  "sn7.10:5.1": "This ascetic mustn’t have ",
  "sn7.10:5.2": "carpets that for seven months ",
  "sn7.10:5.3": "have been infested with fleas: ",
  "sn7.10:5.4": "that’s why this ascetic is happy. ",
  "sn7.10:6.1": "This ascetic mustn’t have ",
  "sn7.10:6.2": "seven widowed daughters ",
  "sn7.10:6.3": "with one or two children